sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant App as Hawk app
  participant Fn as Cloud Functions
  participant DB as Firestore
  participant G as Google OAuth
  participant CB as oauth_callback (https)
  App->>Fn: begin_connection(google_drive)
  Fn->>Fn: create PKCE verifier + challenge
  Fn->>DB: store verifier in oauthChallenges (no client access)
  Fn-->>App: authorize URL + challengeId
  App->>G: open the consent screen in a browser
  U->>G: approve access
  G->>CB: redirect with authorization code
  CB-->>App: 302 to the app's custom scheme (makes no decision)
  App->>Fn: complete_connection(code, challengeId)
  Fn->>DB: load the verifier
  Fn->>G: exchange code + verifier
  G-->>Fn: refresh token + access token
  Fn->>Fn: encrypt the refresh token (AES-GCM)
  Fn->>DB: save in storageAccounts/id/private (denied to every client)
  Fn-->>App: account connected
